msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, uh... Maybe you heard somethin' about it bein' in this area?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Nope, don't think so... Whatever ended up getting buried all those years ago"
" is probably still in the ground. Besides, isn't the Yamashita treasure just"
" an urban legend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Yes, well... I s'pose this area has changed quite a bit over the years..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Hrm... Now I'm in a pickle... I need to be headin' back to\r\n"
"Tochigi next week, and I've no idea where to look next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Something wrong, old-timer? I couldn't help but overhear you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Oh... Well... I'm actually on a search. Treasure hunt's\r\n"
"more like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "A treasure hunt? Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Why sure... Here, take a look-see. I've got me a map and\r\n"
"everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "How did this end up in your hands?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I've had it this whole time. See, this is a map to the treasure my friends "
"and I buried while we were stationed in Okinawa during the war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Okay. And what was this treasure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"It was... Well, we were being evacuated at the time, so we buried whatever "
"we couldn't carry to lighten the load."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Wait, you never heard of this one? The story of the Yamashita treasure? "
"Y'know, all that gold the army buried?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Well, this map has the location of that very same treasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"We all said we'd come dig it up after the war, but we got so caught up in "
"the... I guess you'd call it the aftermath, that we never made it back to "
"what was ours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Now I know I ain't got much time left in this world...\r\n"
"But the thought of claimin' the treasure still haunts me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Please... Will you help an old man find his lost fortune?\r\n"
"It's right here on this map... I swear it, or I'm as good as dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Sorry... Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Not like there'll be another time... *sigh* But why should you believe me? A"
" crazy old coot and his cockamamie war stories..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Never you mind. I'll find it myself somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Treasure hunting does sound like a nice diversion.\r\n"
"Okay, I'll help you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Many thanks, young man. Once we find this treasure, I'll\r\n"
"make sure you get your share."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Well then, here's a copy of the map.\r\n"
"Let's split up and search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>Old Map Copy<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Name's Tabayashi, by the way. I'll give you my cell phone\r\n"
"number, too. Give me a call if you find anything, y'hear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Got it. I'm Kiryu, by the way. So all I have to do is follow\r\n"
"this map?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Mhm. Make sure to call me when you find the treasure, too.\r\n"
"Don't go pullin' any fast ones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "I'll help you, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

